    "text": "おいしい　です！\nゆずLimo とてもおいしいです\n必ずまた来ます。\n\nLocale molto carino, personale super gentile e yuzu limo fenomenale. I vantaggi di vivere a Berlino sono questi, avere piccoli posti del genere dove ti senti a casa !\nCi tornerò sicuramente\n\nSehr schöner, gemütlicher Laden, super freundliches Personal und eine wirklich phänomenale Yuzu-Limo! Genau das sind die Vorteile, in Berlin zu leben: solche kleinen, besonderen Orte zu entdecken, an denen man sich sofort wie zu Hause fühlt. ❤️\n\nIch komme auf jeden Fall wieder!",
    "textTranslated": "Thank you!\n\nYum!\n\nI love this place!\n\n\nVery cute local, super friendly staff, and a phenomenal yuzu lemonade. These are the advantages of living in Berlin: discovering these small, special places where you immediately feel at home!\n\nI'll definitely be back!\n\nVery nice, cozy shop, super friendly staff, and a truly phenomenal yuzu lemonade! These are exactly the advantages of living in Berlin: discovering these small, special places where you immediately feel at home. ❤️\n\nI'll definitely be back!"
  },
